    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Slices</h2>Cosmo's Pizzarama is a dungeon-crawling RPG set in space. Collect pizza toppings, from pepperoni to anchovy, to add to your pizza blaster. Each topping adds a unique modifier to your attack--from fiery pepper blasts to bouncy escargot slices. Pair up to six toppings on a pizza pie to build the ultimate attack.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241740/extras/d787064f2310b56ae3999b54f251a0b2.avif?t=1726471183\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover A Galactic Conspiracy</h2>Along the way, you'll uncover a galactic conspiracy. Hordes of corrupted enemies stand in your path, and they're not going to back down without a fight. Luckily for you, someone... or something wants you to fight back. Enlist the help of a god-like race of aliens to build up your Cosmic power. Use this newfound power to unlock new abilities like teleportation and healing. You're definitely gonna need it...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241740/extras/58eec2c21ad0e3d96a112fffe76b2616.avif?t=1726471183\" /></span>",
